4d4f391e777166\" href=\"?note=e74d4f391e777166\" title=\"20-thm-low2-domination\">20-thm-low2-domination</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fc88f329ff785b03\" href=\"?note=fc88f329ff785b03\" title=\"20-thm-high-function-enumeration\">20-thm-high-function-enumeration</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T\\varnothing\\prime\">\\(A\\le_T\\varnothing\\prime\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Low}_2(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Low}_2(A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TotComp}^A=\\{\\Phi_e^A:\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^A)=\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{TotComp}^A=\\{\\Phi_e^A:\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^A)=\\omega\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8756810b413a47d8\" href=\"?note=8756810b413a47d8\" title=\"20-df-uniform-matrix\">20-df-uniform-matrix</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e74d4f391e777166\" href=\"?note=e74d4f391e777166\" title=\"20-thm-low2-domination\">20-thm-low2-domination</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fc88f329ff785b03\" href=\"?note=fc88f329ff785b03\" title=\"20-thm-high-function-enumeration\">20-thm-high-function-enumeration</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}low2-uniform-functions}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Uniform}_{\\varnothing\\prime}(\\mathsf{TotComp}^A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}low2-uniform-functions}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Uniform}_{\\varnothing\\prime}(\\mathsf{TotComp}^A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由相对支配表征取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\prime\">\\(0\\prime\\)</span> 可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>，最终支配每个全 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算函数的停止时间。沿用 high-function-enumeration 的“全部较小输入检查”矩阵：总函数在足够大的有限偏移 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 上整行正确；任一失败行首次失败后恒为 0，仅有限多个非零值。因此每行均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算；不能把一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\prime\">\\(0\\prime\\)</span> 可计算矩阵的所有行自动认作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 4.9.2；Exercise 4.9.5 的支配证明；印刷页 102, 103；PDF 第 138, 139 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n<p>续修说明：具体行公式为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x,\\langle e,i\\rangle)=\\Phi_e^A(x)\">\\(f(x,\\langle e,i\\rangle)=\\Phi_e^A(x)\\)</span> 当全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\le x\">\\(z\\le x\\)</span> 的计算在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i+g(z)\">\\(i+g(z)\\)</span> 内停止，否则取 0；各次有界模拟由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T0\\prime\">\\(A\\le_T0\\prime\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\le_T0\\prime\">\\(g\\le_T0\\prime\\)</span> 完成。沿用的有限检查构造直接引用 high-function-enumeration，而不假设 A 本身 high。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-uniform-matrix","status":"resolved","id":"8756810b413a47d8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-uniform-matrix]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-low2-domination","status":"resolved","id":"e74d4f391e777166","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerp